    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 Created to protect a huge building in what is now the Elven Ruins, he was discarded without having the opportunity to display his ability when the Elves suddenly abandoned the island. Now this Guardian wanders the ruins, punishing trespassing adventurers and foolish grave robbers. Magic Creatures Lv. 2 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Magic Creatures. P. Def. +5% Max HP +3% Received Critical Damage -10% Received M. Crit. Damage -10% Resistance to Bleed +20% Resistance to Bow +10% Resistance to Crossbow +10% Speed -5 Resistance to Blunt -10% Resistance to Dual Blunt -10% Greater Bow/Crossbow Resistance Lv. 2 Highly resistant to Bow/Crossbows. Dagger/Rapier Resistance Lv. 3 Resistant to Dagger/Rapier attacks. Blunt Weapon Vulnerability Lv. 1 Vulnerable to Blunt Weapons. Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
